# 📊 Telco Customer Churn Prediction App

An interactive machine learning app that predicts whether a telecom customer is likely to churn based on their contract, payment method, tenure, and billing details.

🚀 Built with:
- Python
- Streamlit
- Scikit-learn
- Pandas
- Joblib

## 🎯 Features

- Interactive web app UI
- Predict churn in real-time
- Uses a trained Random Forest model
- Visualizes key inputs like:
  - Contract Type
  - Internet Service
  - Payment Method
  - Tenure & Billing info

---

## 🚀 Live Demo

👉 [Click here to try the app](https://telco-churn-ml-app-m3veta6rrgkwmiqdgwekap.streamlit.app/)

---

## 🧠 Sample Inputs

- 📆 Tenure (months): `0–72`
- 💰 Monthly Charges: `0.00–150.00`
- 🧾 Total Charges
- 🔁 Contract Type: `Month-to-month`, `One year`, `Two year`
- 🌐 Internet Service: `DSL`, `Fiber optic`, `No`
- 💳 Payment Method: `Electronic check`, `Mailed check`, etc.

